{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-08_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-08","title":"意志","storyCode":"1-8","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"98a8aacf09d870184b076ca20029d236a19a962f410d881fbead24d8bc5268fb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"タルラの強大な力を前に、アーミヤは■■■■を選んだ。\nそれでも、タルラのアーツを受け止めきることは出来ない。限界を迎えようとしていたその時、Aceが彼女の前へと立ち、アーミヤとドクターたちを逃がしてくれた。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十一关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、ドクターを連れて離脱してくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"急げ、今すぐに！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな……そんなことできません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"君も感じ取っているだろう！　このままでは、全員ここで命を落とすことになりかねん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"あのタルラという人物は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"彼女は、まさしく怪物だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それでも、一緒に戦います！　そうすれば、きっと可能性は……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――ドクターのことはどうする？　安全を確保できるのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……そ、れは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"E4小隊！　これより、この場にとどまり、奴らを足止めするぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤとDr.{@nickname}、そして医療班が撤退する時間を稼ぐんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――待った。その役目、俺たちに任せてもらおうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace、何を言って――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"任せてくれと言ってるんだ。俺は本気だぞ、ニアール。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"だが……！　周囲のすべてを融かしてしまう相手に、どう対処しようというんだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そうですよ！　あなたたちを残して、撤退なんてできません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスは……絶対に、みなさんを見捨てたりはしませんから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、もう時間がない！　撤退するんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――頼む、俺たちを信じてくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、ですが……！　ロドスの仲間が犠牲になったらと思うと……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"作戦目標を忘れるな！　何のためにここへ来たのか、思い出せ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もとの目標が何であろうと、これだけは譲りたくないんです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだ……？　彼女の手に、何かが集まって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"ま、周りの空間が……歪んでるような……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――いや、あれは陽炎だ！　熱された空気のせいで、景色が揺らめいて見えるのだろう……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　気をつけてください！　あのアーツは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"待って……ダメ！　ニアールさん！　戻ってください！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは、ただのアーツなんかじゃ――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――少し、静かにしてもらおうか。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、あっ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……っはあ、はぁ……ッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"まずいッ――ニアール！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"が、はっ……来るな！　この程度……大したことは、ない……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……こんな……火傷、くらい……で……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"火傷くらい、だと……？　バカを言うな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"鎧をそこまで傷つけられておいて、強がるんじゃない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"これ以上戦うのはよせ、すぐに離脱を――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――来るなと、言ったはずだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、この頑固者め……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――ふむ、面白い。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"伏せろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐっ、ごほっ……今のは、一体……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"辺り一帯が融け落ちていく……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"まるで、見えない炎が頭上で広がっているような……あんなものを喰らえば、ひとたまりもないぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"こうなれば全員、撤退だ！　無駄な犠牲を出すわけにはいかん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我々は……何を、相手に……しているんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、あのアーツを止めないことには打開できんな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――狙撃オペレーター！　奴に照準を！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――確かに……抵抗とは、大地に希望を芽吹かせるものだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、その抵抗が貴様らの運命を変えることはない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"撃てッ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――チェルノボーグは解放された。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"それを以て、我らはすでに目的を果たしていたが……貴様らに、少し興味が湧いてな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"何……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、あくまで興味をそそられただけ、なのだが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"何しろ、貴様らは選択を誤ったのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスよ。――真の意味で、感染者側に立つべきだったな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"何が……起きたんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして、広場中が焼けて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"今のは、一体――けほっ、ごほっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"い、息をするだけで……喉が、焼けて……しまいそう……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"な……何もかも、燃え尽きちまった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"奴のそばには、弓矢どころか、石ころすらも残ってない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"この一瞬で……周りのすべてを、焼き尽くしたのか……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――貴様らが、解放者にふさわしい粘り強さを持っていることは認めよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……こんなふうに、塵も残さず燃やしてしまえるなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ。これでわかったはずだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――誰かが残って、奴を止めなければならない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――だが、それにはもう飽いた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_11_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"貴様らは同胞を殺めたのだ。報いを受けさせねばなるまい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、私好みの結末へと導いてやろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――滅びよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ、まずい……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"退避しろ！　行け、早く行けッ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"あんな攻撃を喰らったら終わりだ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"急げ、アーミヤとドクターを守れ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、これでは間に合わん――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"私が奴を足止めする！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"きゃああっ！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……あ、れ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"あ……アーミヤさん！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――誰一人、傷つけさせはしません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_reflect"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"絶対に……止めてみせます！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――ほう？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、っ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私が……守ら、ないと……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"たった一人で……あのアーツを、押しとどめているのか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、あれほどの規模だ……受け止めきるのは無理があるぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"たとえアーミヤでも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"彼女のアーツを以てしても、長くはもたん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな……アーミヤさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……問題、ありません……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は……大丈夫、ですっ……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさんを……守らないと、いけませんから……！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……黒い障壁が……アーツを、阻んでくれてる……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"く……う、ああっ……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"ま、まずい……！　障壁が燃えていくぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、もうよせ！！　このままでは、お前の指輪が――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ごめんなさい、ドクター……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"たとえ……そうなったとしても……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それが厄災を招くことになったとしても……そして、私自身がどうなろうとも……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は、二度と……目の前で、大切な人を……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――ふっ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"良い覚悟だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っあ……ああああっ……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"くっ……これ以上、黙って見てはいられん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"何をするつもりだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"あの厄介な龍のアーツを止める！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"お前、まさか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――「カジミエーシュの光芒よ、この耀騎士が身を捧げよう」！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、ドクター！　早く行け！　我々がアーミヤをサポートする！　だからお前は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――はァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"う、ああああっ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ、え……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もう大丈夫だ、アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――Ace、さん……？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は十分頑張った。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"だから、一人で重荷を背負うな。俺たちにも少しは分けてくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――ドーベルマン、皆を連れて先に行け！　それと、ニアール！　この場は俺たちに任せてもらおう！　……なに、すぐ追いつくさ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……Ace、お前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そん、な……Aceさん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、絶対に……帰ってきて、ください……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"お前さんは、きっと俺のことを覚えちゃいないんだろうが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"俺のほうは、お前のことを覚えてる。昔どんな奴だったのかってこともな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"……いつの日か、お前には……アーミヤと一緒に、この残酷な大地と向き合うべき時がくるだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"だからどうか、あの子を守ってやってくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――さあ、行くんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"幸運を祈る！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Ace","アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["タルラ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["ニアール"]}]}
